                  "text": "Latino USA started at the Center for Mexican American Studies at the University of Texas at Austin in 1993. The goal of the half-hour radio program was to share the full Latino/a experience in the United States, which was largely excluded from traditional American broadcast media. Maria Hinojosa joined the Latino USA team as host. "
